    "The original lab read returned exactly5MiB of incomplete JSON even though the job exited0 and retired. Its complete first payload was retained, and a new bounded read validated all4 hashes/completion and returned the missing payloads. Exact truncation layer is not established; neither the RF source nor the transmission was repeated.",
